  "security_conclusions": [
    "read verifies regular exact-revision envelope/payload blobs, same-directory owner/name, stored length/hash, existing full tested commit and ancestry. UTF-8/16/32, escaped/removed markers, malformed/wrapped/nested storage objects fail closed; archival formats never use the execution reader.",
    "XZ decoding uses FORMAT_XZ, fixed 64 MiB memlimit, raw length plus one output bound, CRC64, EOF and empty unused_data. Exact raw length/hash rejects bombs, truncation, unsupported checks, corruption, concatenation, trailing bytes and wrong declared codecs. Gzip remains the capture default and all inclusive budgets are unchanged.",
    "New conversions require actual protected-base ancestry, own compact source snapshots present byte-exact in working tree and HEAD, same-owner/subtree destinations, original-envelope-hash filenames, collision rejection, complete immutable map bindings and raw/execution equality. Both original and replacement envelope selections remain excluded from a second conversion.",
    "Current source retirement is mandatory for relocation. Payload retirement is admitted only after all live same-owner references are accounted for; replacements share content bytes while preserving independent execution authority. Snapshot SHA256/length and regular Git blob proofs hold for both mapped entries at original source and reviewed replacement revision.",
    "Retained conversion maps prove byte-identical first-parent admission before import, unique original merge-base, unchanged protected paths during base advance, original-prefix audit, and admission ancestry for every actual-base descendant containing source. Every revision/parent retains map/binding checks. Reversed-parent late admission and byte-identical late recreation reject.",
    "Global history classification covers foreign/transient/Unicode/wrapped/renamed reserved content across all parents. Inherited maps reverify originals for all owners even on unrelated/no-change audits. A payload classification exception requires full exact-revision bound retrieval, never suffix-based decoder guessing or later HEAD proof.",
    "storage_bookkeeping_only rejects conversion records, existing compact envelope/payload mutations and restored transient conversions in tested/review suffixes. Generic review availability uses historical reviewed-SHA retrieval only for an absent current path; invalid present entries/parents and unavailable sources still reject.",
    "Installed-only isolated validator/decoder tests reject poisoned candidates and missing/changed pins. The candidate inventory has eleven independently matched asset hashes at tested and reviewed revisions; it supplies no installation/admission authority.",
    "Single-writer rollback restores original bytes and removes replacement/map outputs for ordinary failures. Concurrent writers and crash recovery remain explicitly excluded; interrupted mutation stays blocked. No runtime, DB, provider export, credential, command-authority or production/shadow path is added."
  ],
